; Generated by scripts/prepare-llama-server.js.
; This checked-in fallback intentionally contains no payload. `npm run prepare:llama-server`
; replaces it with an opt-in installer page only after it has prepared a real,
; platform-matched llama.cpp payload. This keeps clean and reproducible builds
; from advertising or attempting to package an ignored developer-local binary.
!macro NSIS_HOOK_PREUNINSTALL
  RMDir /r "$INSTDIR\_up_\ui\desktop\llama.cpp"
!macroend
